Donde florece mi cielo · third-party assets and sources

## Music samples (CC0; credit not required, given with thanks)
- VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios),
  FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), played through the Lemo-Opuscar library's core/audio/sampler.py.
  Instruments: harp, flute, glockenspiel, hand chimes, glass harp, vibraphone, violins, violins tremolo, violas,
  cellos, contrabass, timpani, suspended cymbal.
- Crickets, wind, rain and the air of the moving light are procedural (core/audio/sfx.py and mix.py).

