## Code
- engine.py is adapted from the Firefly Pointillism demo of Lemo-Opuscar (https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar),
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Lemomo (LemoLab). The MIT licence text: https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar/blob/main/LICENSES/MIT.txt
